The systems sit in three [zones]{.mark}: a no-till zone, a tilled zone, and a mixed zone where both occur. That spatial arrangement is deliberate, and it is the reason the tillage contrast is not a clean comparison. The consequence is on [the practice contrast and where it sits](#sec-casys-confounding).

